f=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0cb59478595f5c6\" href=\"?note=a0cb59478595f5c6\" title=\"67-df-rosser-sentence\">67-df-rosser-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d404f437f90ff5f6\" href=\"?note=d404f437f90ff5f6\" title=\"67-df-consistency-statement\">67-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8c48c66841a15eb9\" href=\"?note=8c48c66841a15eb9\" title=\"67-df-provability-conditions\">67-df-provability-conditions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6a4c234306a0ec0c\" href=\"?note=6a4c234306a0ec0c\" title=\"67-df-provability-predicate\">67-df-provability-predicate</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 5; Corollary 3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"27–28"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"38–39"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮核对形式陈述、类型、变量绑定和册内依赖；未重新核验原书 PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述已与原书逐项核对；已读源证明，未独立形式化其全部算术化细节"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"input_verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"input_source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-revised"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是固定原始递归公理呈示；采用本册固定句法编号、标准证明算术化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\\)</span> 成立，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8c48c66841a15eb9\" href=\"?note=8c48c66841a15eb9\" title=\"67-df-provability-conditions\">67-df-provability-conditions</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a0cb59478595f5c6\" href=\"?note=a0cb59478595f5c6\" title=\"67-df-rosser-sentence\">67-df-rosser-sentence</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ros}_T(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ros}_T(R)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T,\\mathrm{Con}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T,\\mathrm{Con}_T\\)</span> 使用同一呈示，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"d404f437f90ff5f6\" href=\"?note=d404f437f90ff5f6\" title=\"67-df-consistency-statement\">67-df-consistency-statement</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 是公理代码变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\">\\(u,v\\)</span> 是证明代码及结论代码变量，三者各异。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{E_T}\">\\(\\sigma_{E_T}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_T,\\sigma_{T;\\psi},T+\\psi,\\mathrm{Con}_{T+\\psi}\">\\(\\sigma_T,\\sigma_{T;\\psi},T+\\psi,\\mathrm{Con}_{T+\\psi}\\)</span> 由下式定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a> 的同一公式证明构造。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a>。固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_T=(0,e_T)\">\\(E_T=(0,e_T)\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Present}_{L_A}(T,E_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Present}_{L_A}(T,E_T)\\)</span>；固定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{T,E_T}(\\mathrm{Prf}_T,e_{\\mathrm{prf},T})\">\\(\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{T,E_T}(\\mathrm{Prf}_T,e_{\\mathrm{prf},T})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)=\\exists u\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_T(u,v)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)=\\exists u\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_T(u,v)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"6a4c234306a0ec0c\" href=\"?note=6a4c234306a0ec0c\" title=\"67-df-provability-predicate\">67-df-provability-predicate</a> 的定义；扩张不另选独立呈示。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma_T(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_{E_T}(z),\\\\\n\\sigma_{T;\\psi}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_T(z)\\lor z=\\overline{g(\\psi)},\\\\\nT+\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq T\\cup\\{\\psi\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_{T+\\psi}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma_{T;\\psi}}\n\\qquad(\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma_T(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_{E_T}(z),\\\\\n\\sigma_{T;\\psi}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_T(z)\\lor z=\\overline{g(\\psi)},\\\\\nT+\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq T\\cup\\{\\psi\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_{T+\\psi}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma_{T;\\psi}}\n\\qquad(\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Con}_T\\}&amp;\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(R)})\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\neg R)})\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Con}_T\\}&amp;\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}_{T+R}\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{T+\\neg R}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Con}_T\\}&amp;\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(R)})\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\neg R)})\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Con}_T\\}&amp;\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}_{T+R}\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{T+\\neg R}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 2.5 与 Corollary 2.3, pp.27–28（PDF 38–39）；原书第一项只需 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq Q\">\\(T\\supseteq Q\\)</span>，本条明确采用更强的 PA 基础，以复用同页给出的短证明及标准 BL 接口，不声称覆盖弱基础的全部一般性。</p>\n<p>在 PA 中形式化 Rosser 最短证明比较与可证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 完备性，可分别推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(R)\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\neg R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(R)\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\neg R)\\)</span> 与反向蕴涵；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_T\\)</span> 排除两者。标准形式化演绎定理将扩张的一致性化为对应否定不可证，得到第二行。已读原书的长证明与 PA 情形短证明，但没有独立形式化原书 Corollary 1.10(b) 和有限最小证明算术化，故本项保持受限证明资格。</p>\n<p>单公理扩张的内部一致性句由基础公理公式加上单个句子代码直接生成；同一个外部公理集合的任意其他数值化不替代此构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-rosser-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"a0cb59478595f5c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-rosser-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"d404f437f90ff5f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"8c48c66841a15eb9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-provability-conditions]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula-provability","status":"resolved","id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":fals